  "question": "求 $y'' - \\frac{3}{x - 1} y' - \\frac{5}{(x - 1)^2} y = 3$ 的通解.",
  "answer": "y = C _ {1} \\mathrm{e} ^ {5 t} + C _ {2} \\mathrm{e} ^ {- t} - \\frac {1}{3} \\mathrm{e} ^ {2 t} = C _ {1} (x - 1) ^ {5} + C _",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "欧拉方程",
    "可降阶"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 方程两边同时乘以 $(x - 1)^2$ ，是欧拉方程. 将 $x - 1 = e^t$ 转化为常系数非齐次线性方程."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "方程为 $(x - 1)^2 y'' - 3(x - 1)y' - 5y = 3(x - 1)^2$ ，这是一个欧拉方程."
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "令 $x - 1 = \\mathbf{e}^t$ ，或 $t = \\ln (x - 1)$ ，记 $D = \\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}$ ，方程化为"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "$$\nD (D - 1) y - 3 D y - 5 y = 3 \\mathrm{e} ^ {2 t} \\Rightarrow D ^ {2} y - 4 D y - 5 y = 3 \\mathrm{e} ^ {2 t}.\n$$"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "方程的通解为"
      },
      {
        "id": "s6",
        "text": "$$\ny = C _ {1} \\mathrm{e} ^ {5 t} + C _ {2} \\mathrm{e} ^ {- t} - \\frac {1}{3} \\mathrm{e} ^ {2 t} = C _ {1} (x - 1) ^ {5} + C _ {2} \\frac {1}{x - 1} - \\frac {1}{3} (x - 1) ^ {2}.\n$$"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "y = C _ {1} \\mathrm{e} ^ {5 t} + C _ {2} \\mathrm{e} ^ {- t} - \\frac {1}{3} \\mathrm{e} ^ {2 t} = C _ {1} (x - 1) ^ {5} + C _",
